WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.300
One repair. Not three disconnected jobs.

00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:08.100
Complete the repair on its service record.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:12.700
One part is deducted. Stock changes from 24 to 23.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.800
A repeated request is recognized. Stock stays at 23.

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:21.400
The repair, stock balance and movement agree.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.000
One repair. Everything aligned.
